@baseUrl = http://localhost:5146

### Logins
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@helpdesk.local", "password": "Admin@12345" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

# @name loginAli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@aliToken = {{loginAli.response.body.token}}

# @name loginSara
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sara@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@saraToken = {{loginSara.response.body.token}}

### 1. Ali tries to assign (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{aliToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentId": 3 }

### 2. Sara assigns to herself (200, status becomes Assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentId": 3 }

### 3. Sara jumps Assigned -> Resolved (400, invalid transition)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Resolved" }

### 4. Sara moves to InProgress (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### 5. Ali tries to close early (400, InProgress -> Closed not allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{aliToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Closed" }

### 6. Sara resolves (200, resolvedAt set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Resolved" }

### 7. Ali closes his resolved ticket (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{aliToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Closed" }

### 8. Sara tries to reopen the closed ticket (403, admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### 9. Admin reopens it (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### 10. Admin reassigns? Not allowed while InProgress? Check: reassign to Sara again (200, no change)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentId": 3 }

### 11. Assign to a requester (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentId": 2 }

### 12. Full history (Ali can see it too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{aliToken}}